          "date": "2026-11-09 17:03:28.000000000",
          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-21165 utils: use int for getopt result in lctl del_ost",
        "message": "LU-21165 utils: use int for getopt result in lctl del_ost\n\njt_del_ost() stored the getopt_long() return value in a char.\nWhere char is unsigned, such as aarch64, the value never matched\n-1, so the loop fell through to the default case and\n\"lctl del_ost\" always printed its usage message, and\nconf-sanity test_123ah would fail with \"del_ost --dryrun failed\".\n\nStore the getopt_long() result in an int.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nTest-Parameters: testlist=conf-sanity env=ONLY=123ah\nFixes: 1121816c4a4e (\"LU-7668 utils: add lctl del_ost\")\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 ltvm llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I036fe9a6e9348cb28ba89062673190aea93ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
